{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-006.md","record_count":13,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s006-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","speaker_label":"சாந்தம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னங்க...ஒக்காருங்க...நீங்க தலைவரு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":19,"printed_page":18}],"source_scene_file":"scene-006.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s006-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","speaker_label":"சேரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வில்லவா! வெற்றி முழங்கும் இந்த இடத்திற்குப் பெயர் என்ன?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":19,"printed_page":18}],"source_scene_file":"scene-006.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s006-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","speaker_label":"வில்லவன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"குயிலாலுவம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":19,"printed_page":18}],"source_scene_file":"scene-006.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s006-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","speaker_label":"சேர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"குயிலாலுவம்; குறித்துக் கொள்! இந்தப் பாறைகள் அணைத்தும் பைந்தமிழர் வீரம் தீட்டிய ஏடுகள்! வெற்றி மட்டும் போதாது வில்லவா; அந்த வீணர்களை விடக்கூடாது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":19,"printed_page":18}],"source_scene_file":"scene-006.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s006-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","speaker_label":"வில்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"காஷாய உடையிலே ரிஷிகளைப் போல் எங்கோ ஓடி விட்டார்களாம் கனக விஜயர்கள்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":19,"printed_page":18}],"source_scene_file":"scene-006.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s006-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","speaker_label":"சேர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஹா...ஹா...! புதுமையல்ல...அவர்களுக்குரியதான ஒரே பழக்கம் அதுதான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":19,"printed_page":18}],"source_scene_file":"scene-006.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s006-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","speaker_label":"கனக விஜயர்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மன்னவா! மண்டியிடுகிறோம். மன்னித்து விடுங்கள்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":19,"printed_page":18}],"source_scene_file":"scene-006.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s006-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","speaker_label":"சேரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மன்னிப்பதா? நான் மன்னிப்பதா? தமிழ் நாட்டு மண்ணில் வந்துமண்டியிடுங்கள், அது உங்களை மன்னிக்கட்டும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":19,"printed_page":18}],"source_scene_file":"scene-006.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s006-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","speaker_label":"வில்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மன்னவா! தமிழகம் திரும்பவேண்டாமா? புறப்பட்டு முப்பத்தி ரெண்டு திங்கள் ஆகின்றனவே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":19,"printed_page":18}],"source_scene_file":"scene-006.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s006-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","speaker_label":"சேர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"புறப்படுவோம்—வில்லவா! அதற்குள் கண்ணகிக்குச் சிலை நாட்ட இங்கு கல் எடுக்க வேண்டுமல்லவா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":19,"printed_page":18}],"source_scene_file":"scene-006.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s006-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","speaker_label":"வில்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":19,"printed_page":18}],"source_scene_file":"scene-006.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s006-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","speaker_label":"சேர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அந்தக் கல்லைச் சுமப்பதற்குச் சரியான எருதுகள் கிடைத்து விட்டன! கனக—விஜயா! தமிழரின் வீரத்தின்மீது வீசினாய் ஒரு சொல்—இப்போது தூக்கு கல்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":19,"printed_page":18}],"source_scene_file":"scene-006.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s006-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s006","scene_ordinal":6,"transition_audit_id":"T006","speaker_label":"வீரர்கள்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"“சேரன் செங்குட்டுவன் வாழ்க!”","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":19,"printed_page":18}],"source_scene_file":"scene-006.md"}]}